<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Ohio Edison cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ohio Edison cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hilliard Lyons utilities analyst David Burk said he cut his recommendation on Ohio Edison Co to hold from buy following its announcement of a merger with Centerior Energy Corp.</p>
<p>--Shares in Ohio Edison were down 1/8 to 19-1/2.</p>
<p>--&quot;The proposed merger is not a merger of equals and ... CX (is) a low quality electric,&quot; Burk said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
